<p>This brief covers stories from 21 to 24 November.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Vendors</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">CrowdStrike and Zscaler<em>endpoint plus network security</em></span></div></div>
